SUMMARY:Luenell LIVE at Jimmy Kimmel's Comedy Club
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout the Performer\nLuenell is one of the most electrifying and fearless stand-up comedians in the game\, known for her explosive energy\, raw honesty\, and unapologetically bold humor. \nShe gained widespread recognition through her breakout role in the hit film Borat and has since appeared in Hotel Transylvania\, Coming 2 America\, and numerous television specials\, cementing her status as a comedy powerhouse. \nLuenell’s stand-up is a force of nature — loud\, proud\, and hilarious — tackling everything from relationships and pop culture to her own life experiences with a no-filter authenticity that audiences absolutely love. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Monday\, July 20\, 2026\nShow Time: 9:30 PM (doors open earlier)\nVenue: Jimmy Kimmel’s Comedy Club\, 3545 S Las Vegas Blvd\, Las Vegas\, NV 89109\nAge Restriction: 18+ Event\nTicket Prices: From $63\n\nAbout the Venue\nJimmy Kimmel’s Comedy Club is one of the premier comedy destinations on the Las Vegas Strip\, located on the iconic LINQ Promenade at 3545 S Las Vegas Blvd. \nThe intimate venue seats approximately 300 guests and features a state-of-the-art sound system\, excellent sightlines from every seat\, and full bar service throughout the show. \nThe club’s cozy atmosphere creates an up-close-and-personal comedy experience unlike the large arena shows Vegas is known for. Parking is available at the LINQ Hotel parking garage\, and the venue is easily accessible via the Las Vegas Monorail. \nThe LINQ Promenade itself offers a variety of dining and entertainment options before and after the show\, making it a perfect evening destination on the Strip. \nWhat to Expect\nLuenell delivers a headline solo stand-up performance that is guaranteed to be one of the most energetic and entertaining shows you’ll see in Las Vegas. \nExpect a high-octane\, laugh-until-you-cry performance where Luenell’s magnetic stage presence and fearless humor take center stage. She commands the room from the moment she walks out\, and her connection with the audience is electric. \nThis is a 18+ event\, and Luenell’s material is adult-oriented\, unfiltered\, and absolutely hilarious. Arrive early to secure your seats and enjoy the full experience at this intimate venue. \nTicket Information\nTickets start from $63 and are available through official and resale channels. \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/luenell-live-at-jimmy-kimmels-comedy-club/
LOCATION:Jimmy Kimmel’s Comedy Club\, 3545 S Las Vegas Blvd\, Las Vegas\, NV\, 89109\, USA
