SUMMARY:Jay Reid LIVE at Jimmy Kimmel's Comedy Club
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nJay Reid LIVE at Jimmy Kimmel’s Comedy Club\nJay Reid brings his “Comedy & Cocktails” show to the world-famous Jimmy Kimmel’s Comedy Club at the LINQ Promenade in Las Vegas on July 23\, 2026. This Las Vegas-raised comedian has won over millions with his sharp humor and infectious energy — don’t miss this unforgettable night of laughs! \nEvent Details\nDate: Thursday\, July 23\, 2026\nTime: 7:30 PM PDT\nVenue: Jimmy Kimmel’s Comedy Club\nAddress: 3545 S Las Vegas Blvd\, Las Vegas\, NV 89109\nAge Requirement: 18+ (All shows are 18+ unless otherwise noted)\nParking: Available at Harrah’s\, Flamingo\, LINQ\, and surface lot. Up to 3 hours free parking for locals. \nAbout Jay Reid\nJay Reid is a Las Vegas-raised comedian and actor who rose to fame after winning Bill Bellamy’s “Who’s Got Jokes?” on TV One. He has released three comedy specials including “L.M.A.O.” and “That Don’t Go Together” on Dry Bar+\, and has appeared on BET’s “Coming to the Stage” and Showtime’s “Ladies Night Out Comedy Special.” His fourth special is on the way\, making this a must-see performance from one of comedy’s rising stars. \nWhat to Expect\n\nHilarious stand-up from a Las Vegas native who knows how to work a crowd\nSharp comedy about relationships\, culture\, and everyday life\nIntimate comedy club setting with cocktails and great vibes\nA performer with multiple TV specials and a proven track record\nOne of the hottest comedy nights on the Las Vegas Strip\n\nVenue Information\nJimmy Kimmel’s Comedy Club is located at the LINQ Promenade on the Las Vegas Strip\, offering an intimate 325-seat venue with a full bar and premium comedy entertainment nightly. The club features top comedians from around the country in a fun\, upscale setting. \nTicket Information\nTickets start from $56. This is a general admission venue — seating is assigned upon arrival. There is a 20-ticket limit per order. Tickets available via Ticketmaster (official) or VividSeats (resale). \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you.\nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/jay-reid-live-at-jimmy-kimmels-comedy-club/
LOCATION:Jimmy Kimmel’s Comedy Club\, 3545 S Las Vegas Blvd\, Las Vegas\, NV\, 89109\, USA
