SUMMARY:2 Pauls\, 1 Show: Paul Ollinger & Paul Farahvar LIVE at Cobb's Comedy Club
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \n\nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets\n\n2 Pauls\, 1 Show: Paul Ollinger & Paul Farahvar LIVE at Cobb’s Comedy Club\nTwo of comedy’s most entertaining voices unite for one unforgettable night! Paul Ollinger and Paul Farahvar bring their unique comedic styles together for a special double-bill show at the legendary Cobb’s Comedy Club in San Francisco. Whether you know them from their stand-up specials\, podcasts\, or live performances\, this is a night of laughs you won’t want to miss. \nEvent Details\nDate: Thursday\, July 23\, 2026\nTime: 7:30 PM PDT (Doors open at 6:30 PM)\nVenue: Cobb’s Comedy Club\nAddress: 915 Columbus Avenue\, San Francisco\, CA 94133\nAge Requirement: 18+ (Valid photo ID required)\nBeverage Minimum: Two-drink minimum per person \nAbout Paul Ollinger & Paul Farahvar\nPaul Ollinger is a stand-up comedian and former Facebook VP who brings a sharp\, self-deprecating wit to his performances\, blending corporate satire with personal storytelling. Paul Farahvar is a Bay Area comedian known for his clever observations and high-energy delivery. Together\, they make for a dynamic and hilarious evening of comedy that appeals to a wide range of audiences. \nWhat to Expect\n\nA special double-bill featuring two talented comedians in one show\nSharp\, observational humor from both Paul Ollinger and Paul Farahvar\nAn intimate club atmosphere at the iconic Cobb’s Comedy Club\nDoors open one hour before showtime — arrive early for the best seats\nFull bar service with a two-drink minimum per person\nA fun Thursday night out in San Francisco’s North Beach neighborhood\n\nVenue Information\nCobb’s Comedy Club is one of San Francisco’s most beloved comedy venues\, located at 915 Columbus Avenue in the heart of North Beach. The club has hosted legendary comedians for decades and offers an intimate\, welcoming atmosphere perfect for an evening of live comedy. Street parking is available nearby\, and the venue is easily accessible via public transit. \nTicket Information\nTickets start from $48 and are available through Ticketmaster (official) or VividSeats (resale marketplace). Ticket prices may vary based on availability. All sales are final — no refunds or exchanges unless the event is cancelled or postponed. \n\nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets\n\nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/pauls-show-paul-ollinger-paul-farahvar-live-at-cobbs-comedy-club/
LOCATION:Cobb’s Comedy Club\, 915 Columbus Avenue\, San Francisco\, California\, 94133\, United States Of America
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://comedycalendar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/d8b6b3d8-6cde-458c-a874-add59997305c_RETINA_PORTRAIT_16_9-j6h8sB.jpg
