SUMMARY:Jo Koy Live LIVE at Seminole Hard Rock Tampa Event Center
DESCRIPTION:Official Tickets\nResale Tickets\n\nAbout Jo Koy\nJo Koy is one of today’s premier stand-up comedians\, rising from humble beginnings performing in a Las Vegas coffee house to selling out arenas worldwide. Born Joseph Glenn Herbert\, the Filipino-American comedian has built a massive\, devoted fanbase through his relatable\, high-energy storytelling and infectious laugh. \nKnown for his razor-sharp observational humor rooted in his Filipino-American heritage and family life\, Jo Koy draws from real-life experiences — particularly the hilarious dynamics of raising his son and navigating his large\, boisterous family. His comedy is warm\, inclusive\, and universally funny\, making audiences of all backgrounds feel right at home. \nJo Koy has released multiple Netflix specials including Comin’ In Hot\, In His Elements\, and Live from the Los Angeles Forum\, and was awarded the prestigious “Stand-Up Comedian of the Year” at the 2018 Just For Laughs Comedy Festival in Montreal. His 2026 “Jo Koy Live” tour continues to pack venues across the country. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Thursday\, July 23\, 2026\nShowtime: 8:00 PM\nVenue: Seminole Hard Rock Tampa Event Center\nAddress: 5223 N. Orient Road\, Tampa\, FL 33610\nAge Restriction: 21+ Event — Valid photo ID required for entry\nTicket Prices: Starting at $135 (official) | $217–$675 (resale)\n\nAbout the Venue\nThe Seminole Hard Rock Tampa Event Center is one of Florida’s premier entertainment venues\, located inside the iconic Seminole Hard Rock Hotel & Casino Tampa. The state-of-the-art facility seats thousands of fans and offers an intimate yet electric atmosphere perfect for live comedy performances. \nThe venue features excellent sightlines from virtually every seat\, top-tier sound and lighting systems\, and a full-service bar and dining experience. Guests can enjoy the full Hard Rock casino resort experience before and after the show\, with world-class restaurants\, gaming floors\, and hotel accommodations all on-site. \nParking is available on-site at the casino complex. The venue is located at 5223 N. Orient Road in Tampa\, easily accessible from I-4 and I-75. Guests are encouraged to arrive early to enjoy the resort amenities and ensure smooth entry into the Event Center. \nWhat to Expect\nJo Koy delivers a high-energy\, laugh-out-loud stand-up performance that blends personal storytelling\, family humor\, and sharp cultural observations. Expect a full evening of comedy with Jo Koy headlining — his shows are known for running approximately 90 minutes to 2 hours of non-stop entertainment. \nThis is a 21+ event\, so guests must bring a valid photo ID. The show is presented in a concert-style seated format inside the Hard Rock Event Center. Fans can expect callbacks to his popular Netflix specials as well as brand-new material from his 2026 tour. \nWhether you’re a longtime fan or discovering Jo Koy for the first time\, this is a night of comedy you won’t want to miss. His ability to connect with audiences through genuine\, heartfelt humor makes every show feel personal and unforgettable. \nTicket Information\nOfficial Tickets: Starting at $135 via Ticketmaster\nResale Tickets: $217–$675 via VividSeats \n\nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets\n\nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/jo-koy-live-live-at-seminole-hard-rock-tampa-event-center/
LOCATION:Seminole Hard Rock Tampa Event Center\, 5223 N. Orient Road\, Tampa\, Florida\, 33610\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://media.ticketmaster.com/en-us/dam/a/fb8/e45d0f19-ccb4-4ee3-93d3-7c3b1ff8efb8_1486581_TABLET_LANDSCAPE_LARGE_16_9.jpg
